tatus/2053518674795929751","published_at":"2026-05-10T16:52:59.260Z","published_date":"2026-05-10","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Helloooo, Georgia! 🍑 🗳️ \n\nI am so proud to endorse and support the incredible @ruwaromman for Georgia State Senate, SD7.\n\nEarly voting has already started. The time is NOW to get out the vote and help elect this incredible leader! ruwaforgeorgia.com","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":5135,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__5oLAAIAAAATMjA1NjM5MjM1OTA3NjY3NTg4OQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"dc1652cf90f682fd4b020d39ae3cb52af13093a32208a2d70a77f1561b44db1b","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__5oLAAIAAAATMjA1NjM5MjM1OTA3NjY3NTg4OQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2053073140478034336","post_id":"2053073140478034336","platform":"x","author":"AOC","original_url":"https://x.com/AOC/status/2053073140478034336","published_at":"2026-05-09T11:22:35.601Z","published_date":"2026-05-09","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Once again, it’s not about individual morality. People’s personal sense defensiveness about this is making them blind to the point. It’s really not about punishment. When you care step into a community that’s been ravaged by total lack of protections - say, Puerto Rico, the perspective shifts. I don’t blame Airbnb. They are exploiting the landscape. I do blame things like Act 60.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":4313,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__4ULAAIAAAATMjA1MzE4MDUzODU1OTU3MDM3NQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"b9bf2a6b3eda3b5c08115030fc6ec77a823a1f0693d55bb348e0bf2e0d9fd3fc","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__4ULAAIAAAATMjA1MzE4MDUzODU1OTU3MDM3NQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2052822934646132813","post_id":"2052822934646132813","platform":"x","author":"AOC","original_url":"https://x.com/AOC/status/2052822934646132813","published_at":"2026-05-08T18:48:21.882Z","published_date":"2026-05-08","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Someone can certainly *make* a billion dollars. That’s not the same thing as earning.\n\nGrowing fast and disrupting markets also often means chasing and wielding market power, political influence, and scale.\n\nTake Airbnb. They heavily lobby politicians against passing housing laws to protect working class residents because it’s bad for their business model.\n\nAirbnb could not exist at its current scale and size without the housing market destabilizations, displacements, and exploits that are supercharging the evictions of working people everywhere from Puerto Rico to Jackson Hole.\n\nNow young people are planning for a future where they will never be able to afford to own a home while others have 20 and live off renting it out to them at extortionate rates with zero protections. Yes, a tiny a…","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":17454,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__4ULAAIAAAATMjA1MzE4MDUzODU1OTU3MDM3NQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"b9bf2a6b3eda3b5c08115030fc6ec77a823a1f0693d55bb348e0bf2e0d9fd3fc","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__4ULAAIAAAATMjA1MzE4MDUzODU1OTU3MDM3NQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2052815971878879499","post_id":"2052815971878879499","platform":"x","author":"AOC","original_url":"https://x.com/AOC/status/2052815971878879499","published_at":"2026-05-08T18:20:41.829Z","published_date":"2026-05-08","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Happy to! A lot of CEOs and Silicon Valley folks take commentary like this so personally and from such a moralizing and judgement frame, but it’s really about systems. Our current economic outcomes speak for themselves - we are in a time of record inequality and more working people than ever are struggling.\n\nIt’s more expensive than ever to have a home, go to the doctor, and feed one’s kids. People (rightfully) talk all the time about the corruption of our political system and I don’t take those critiques personall - it’s true! What matters is what choices we make knowing that and how we want to make a better world.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":303,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__4ULAAIAAAATMjA1MzE4MDUzODU1OTU3MDM3NQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"b9bf2a6b3eda3b5c08115030fc6ec77a823a1f0693d55bb348e0bf2e0d9fd3fc","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_statu