lth by underpaying their full-time workers so severely that they must rely on food assistance and government programs to survive, then no, that wealth was not earned by one individual - it was a wealth transfer subsidized by underpaid American workers and the public who get stuck with the bill for large corporations free-riding off our systems.\n\nThe point is less about individual morality. It’s more about how our current economic reality of shattering inequality rewards screwing over workers and exploiting essential systems at scale.\n\nWe’re talking monopoly power. Rent-seeking. Wage theft. Profiteering. Stock buybacks. Destabilizing housing mar…","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":15658,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__4ULAAIAAAATMjA1MzE4MDUzODU1OTU3MDM3NQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"b9bf2a6b3eda3b5c08115030fc6ec77a823a1f0693d55bb348e0bf2e0d9fd3fc","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__4ULAAIAAAATMjA1MzE4MDUzODU1OTU3MDM3NQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2052124057546428623","post_id":"2052124057546428623","platform":"x","author":"AOC","original_url":"https://x.com/AOC/status/2052124057546428623","published_at":"2026-05-06T20:31:16.597Z","published_date":"2026-05-06","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Had a blast with @girlscoutsnyc in Astoria yesterday 🍪✨ Thank you to the girls of Troop 4883 for inviting me!\n\nWe’re trying out something new 🎥 as we bring you along for district work period in New York!","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_coun